          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Function 'transfer' issues two separate await db.commit() calls (lines 94 and 98). A crash between the two commits permanently destroys funds: the source is debited but the destination is never credited. This is a critical ACID violation."
          },
          "locations": [
